Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.42,0:23:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 小皮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.26,0:23:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你幹嘛
